# Marlin-specific vendor_init permissions
#
# vendor_dpmd_data_file is managed by vendor_dpmd and system_server
# directly (see device/qcom/sepolicy-legacy-um/qva/private/dpmd.te and
# system_server.te). vendor_init does not need to touch this data file
# type; any directory creation is handled by the upstream init rules
# for data partition setup.
#
# This file is reserved for marlin-specific supplementary rules.
